{"key": "name:button-name:f9a7529c326b", "issueId": null, "source": "scanner", "outcome": "rerate", "severityBefore": "medium", "severityAfter": "high", "reason": "The unnamed button is the arrow on each Team row (opacity 0 until the row is selected or hovered), and it exposes as button with an empty name on both states. It is the only focusable element in the row, which has no link or tab stop of its own, and Enter on it opens that member's Edit member panel, so keyboard and screen-reader users have no way to pick a member except through 23 identical nameless buttons.", "reasonCode": null, "counterEvidence": "shot:a11y/runs/2026-10-03-1525/shots/verify/verify-326/settings.edit-member-after-arrow-enter.png", "probes": [{"id": "probe-3c4087dd4c59", "state": "settings.edit-member", "kind": "ax", "env": {"viewport": [1440, 900], "dpr": 1, "colorScheme": "light", "reducedMotion": "reduce"}, "value": {"description": "", "ignored": false, "name": "", "role": "button", "states": {}, "template": "button \"\""}, "xpath": "/html/body/div[1]/main[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[4]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[1]/div[2]/div[1]/div[1]/div[4]/button[1]", "build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "pass": null}, {"id": "probe-5907847728db", "state": "settings.edit-member-dirty", "kind": "ax", "env": {"viewport": [1440, 900], "dpr": 1, "colorScheme": "light", "reducedMotion": "reduce"}, "value": {"description": "", "ignored": false, "name": "", "role": "button", "states": {}, "template": "button \"\""}, "xpath": "/html/body/div[1]/main[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[4]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[1]/div[2]/div[1]/div[1]/div[4]/button[1]", "build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "pass": null}], "states": ["settings.edit-member", "settings.edit-member-dirty"], "build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "model": "sonnet", "batch": "verify-326", "prompt": "verifier@3", "attempt": 1, "second": false, "date": "2026-10-03", "criterionAnalysis": null}
{"key": "role-state:autocomplete-valid:5900e07667a3", "issueId": null, "source": "scanner", "outcome": "drop", "severityBefore": "medium", "severityAfter": "medium", "reason": "On both states the Role combobox carries autocomplete=\"garbage\", a deliberate token to switch off browser autofill. It sets another team member's role in an admin form and is not one of the WCAG input purposes, so 1.3.5 has nothing to identify.", "reasonCode": "not-aa-failure", "counterEvidence": "probe-d3f3f2bfaa93", "probes": [{"id": "probe-d3f3f2bfaa93", "state": "settings.edit-member", "kind": "ax", "env": {"viewport": [1440, 900], "dpr": 1, "colorScheme": "light", "reducedMotion": "reduce"}, "value": {"description": "", "ignored": false, "name": "Role", "role": "combobox", "states": {"expanded": false, "haspopup": "listbox"}, "template": "combobox \"Role\" [expanded=false, haspopup=listbox]"}, "xpath": "/html/body/div[1]/main[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[4]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[1]/aside[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/form[1]/div[1]/div[2]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/input[1]", "build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "pass": null}, {"id": "probe-4d97345c62f2", "state": "settings.edit-member-dirty", "kind": "ax", "env": {"viewport": [1440, 900], "dpr": 1, "colorScheme": "light", "reducedMotion": "reduce"}, "value": {"description": "", "ignored": false, "name": "Role", "role": "combobox", "states": {"expanded": false, "haspopup": "listbox"}, "template": "combobox \"Role\" [expanded=false, haspopup=listbox]"}, "xpath": "/html/body/div[1]/main[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[4]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[1]/aside[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/form[1]/div[1]/div[2]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/input[1]", "build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "pass": null}], "states": ["settings.edit-member", "settings.edit-member-dirty"], "build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "model": "sonnet", "batch": "verify-326", "prompt": "verifier@3", "attempt": 1, "second": false, "date": "2026-10-03", "criterionAnalysis": "1.3.5 Identify Input Purpose applies to fields that collect information about the user and serve a purpose in the WCAG list (name, email, address, job title as organization-title and so on). The Role field edits the role of the team member being edited, not the signed-in user's own data, and neither a Mercury role nor a department is on the list. An invalid token changes nothing for any user: browsers ignore it, and the accessible name (Role) and role (combobox) stay intact, so 4.1.2 holds. No other A or AA criterion covers the attribute."}
