pt": 1, "second": false, "date": "2026-10-03", "criterionAnalysis": "1.3.5 Identify Input Purpose applies to fields that collect information about the user and serve a purpose in the WCAG list (name, email, address, job title as organization-title and so on). The Department field edits the department of the team member being edited, not the signed-in user's own data, and neither a Mercury role nor a department is on the list. An invalid token changes nothing for any user: browsers ignore it, and the accessible name (Department) and role (combobox) stay intact, so 4.1.2 holds. No other A or AA criterion covers the attribute."}
